{"rowNumber":1081,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1081","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくが激しく動きすぎたせいか、おまんこからちんこが抜けてしまい、\n中空に吐き出された精液が、水蓮姉の身体を白く染め上げていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1085,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1085","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぎゅうぎゅうな膣肉の締め付けから開放された射精は爽快感のある気持ちよさで、\n白濁で汚れていく水蓮姉の姿に達成感のようなものまで感じ、満たされていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1099,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1099","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！！\nふふふ、たくさん……はぁ、はぁ、出たね……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1103,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1103","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくの射精が終わったところで、\n水蓮姉はくすりと微笑みかけてきた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1107,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1107","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その笑みを見て、ぼくは今更になって\nとんでもないことをしてしまったと慌ててしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1112,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1112","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ご、ごめん……！！　精液をかけちゃったのもそうだし、\n水蓮姉がダメって言ってたのに、止められなくて……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1117,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1117","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ……ううん、気にしないで？\nむしろお姉ちゃんは嬉しかったよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1122,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1122","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「う、嬉しかったって……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1126,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1126","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……どうだった？　たまにはこういうワガママも、気持ちよかったでしょ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1129,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1129","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくを責めるでもなく水蓮姉が微笑みかけてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1132,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1132","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もしかして、ぼくの口から本心を聞きたかったとかじゃなくて、\nもっと単純に、ぼくに素直な気持ちを発散させようとしてたのかも。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1136,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1136","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"だとすると、ダメとか、やめてと言っていたのも、\nなんというか、ぼくを煽るための言葉だったとかじゃ……？","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1142,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1142","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「それにしても本当にたくさん出たね？\n今までで一番かも」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1147,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1147","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「なのに、ふふ。こんなに硬いままなんて。\nやっぱり一度だけじゃ足りないんだ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1151,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1151","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"言いながら、水蓮姉が愛おしそうに\nおまんこを竿に優しく押しつけてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1155,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1155","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"それだけでぼくの心臓はドクンと音を立てて跳ねた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1159,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1159","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「、どうしたい？\nこのおちんちん、どうしたいのかな？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1164,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1164","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ぼくは……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1167,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1167","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"再び身体が火照っていく。\n誘うような水蓮姉の笑みに興奮が高まっていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1171,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1171","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ここまでしてくれているんだ。今更水蓮姉の手のひらの上だったとか、\n割とどうでもいいように思う……今は、それよりも──","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1176,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1176","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「もう一度、したい……水蓮姉ともっと、セックスしたいって思ってる……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1180,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1180","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「……ふふ。じゃあこのままもう一回、しよっか？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1184,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1184","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「今度はもっともーっと、ワガママしていいからね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1187,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1187","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉は蠱惑的に微笑むと、\n一度挿入してほぐれきった割れ目をくぱぁと開いて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1201,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1201","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んんっ……あ、はぁぁぁん……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1204,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1204","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"射精直後の敏感なちんこを労るように、\n優しくゆっくりと腰を落としてくれた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1209,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1209","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「んぁ……あぁ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1212,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1212","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その身も心も蕩けるような熱い蜜壺の感触に、\n思わず口から喘ぎ声が漏れてしまう。気持ちいい……。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1216,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1216","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"絶頂を経たからか、先ほどよりも熱く、優しく抱かれているような……\nそんな酔心地に満たされてしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1221,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1221","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ……んはぁ、ふふふ。\n幸せ。膣内でおちんちんが、んん、飛び跳ねてる」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1226,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1226","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私の膣内に挿れてもらえて嬉しいって。\n私とのセックスが気持ちいいって」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1230,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1230","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉は、少し冗談めかして膣内に収められたちんこの気持ちを代弁する。\n実際、その通りだと思う。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1235,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1235","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「こんなに喜んでもらえると、んはぁん……！\n私もどんどん嬉しくなっちゃう」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1239,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1239","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ちんこの感触をじっくり味わうように、\n水蓮姉が腰をグラインドさせる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1243,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1243","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"まるで「突いていいよ」とぼくに告げているように。\n緩慢に、扇情的に、ぼくの目と下半身を刺激してきてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1247,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1247","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"今日、何回この言葉を思ったかわからないが、こんなの我慢できるわけがない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1253,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1253","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あぁんっ――！　あっ、はぁんっ、んぁああんっ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1256,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1256","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"一度突き上げたら、もう止まれなかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1260,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1260","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、んはぁんっ、あっ、あっ、あぁあんっ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1269,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1269","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「えへへっ……！　その調子、だよっ？\n遠慮せずに、あぁんっ、動いていいから……ねっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1274,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1274","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「好きにっ……お姉ちゃんの、おまんこっ、あっ、あっ、好きに使ってみてっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1278,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1278","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんも、んはぁっ、ああっ……！！\nもっと気持ちよくなれるように、手伝うから……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1283,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1283","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「うっ、くぅ……水蓮、姉……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1286,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1286","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"不慣れに腰を振るぼくをリードするように、\nぼくの動きに合わせて水蓮姉も動いてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1291,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1291","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふっ、いいんだよっ？\nもっと、あぁんっ、もっと強く突いてみてっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1296,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1296","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「さっき私をイかせようとしていた時みたいにっ……！\n私の身体で気持ちよくなることだけ、考えてっ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1301,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1301","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「わ、かったよっ……！　くっ、ふっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1304,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1304","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の腰使いに牽引されるがまま、\nどんどんぼくの突き上げが激しくなっていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1308,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1308","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"半開きの口から涎が溢れるのもいとわずに、\nぼくは夢中になって水蓮姉のおまんこを突いていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1317,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1317","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あはぁんっ……！　あっ、んぁっ、あぁんっ、あぁああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1320,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1320","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"先ほどと違い、水蓮姉は女性器を締める様に力を込めているみたいで、\nそんな抵抗にちんこを突きこむと、こそぎ取られるような快感が走る。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1324,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1324","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"膣口の方はぎゅっと締め気味なのに、奥の方はねっとりとろとろで……\n水蓮姉の膣内が生み出す快楽に、ぼくはただただ酔いしれていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1330,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1330","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「い、いいっ、はぁああんっ、いいよっ……！！　とってもいいっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1334,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1334","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「すっごく、あぁんっ、素直になってて……！\nあっ、あっ、あっ、自分の気持ちに正直になってて……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1339,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1339","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんも、ふふふふっ……！！\nすっごく、えっちになっちゃうっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1343,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1343","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"一度射精しているというのに、肉欲は天井知らずに上っていく。\n水蓮姉の大事なところに自分が押し入っている感覚が、ぼくを狂わせる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1348,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1348","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んぁ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ……！！　気持ちいいっ、んんんっ、\n今日のセックスっ、この前よりも、あぁあんっ、もっとっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1353,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1353","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ぼくもっ、あああっ……ぼくも、気持ちいい……！\nもっとっ、もっとしたいっ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1362,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1362","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「うんっ、してっ……！！　しようっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1366,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1366","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私、全部受け止める、から……ああっ、ふああっ、ああっ！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1370,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1370","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あっ――あああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1374,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1374","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ベッドのヘリを掴んで力の限り水蓮姉を突き上げる。\n陸揚げされた魚のように身体を跳ね上げて。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1379,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1379","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あぁあああんっっ！！！\nいいっ、ふぁあああんっ、とってもいいっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1383,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1383","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんな格好悪いぼくでも、水蓮姉は喜んで迎えてくれる。\n恍惚とした顔で見つめながら、ぼくの動きに応えてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1387,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1387","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"それが嬉しくて、セックスも気持ちよくて、\nぼくは水蓮姉の身体にのめり込む――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1392,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1392","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁああっ、あぁああんっ、あっ、あっ、あはぁんっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1396,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1396","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「全然っ、声我慢できないっ……！！\nこんなに夜遅くにっ、こんな大声っ、出しちゃってっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1401,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1401","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「部屋の外までっ、はぁああんっ、漏れちゃうかもっ……！！\n私のエッチな声っ、あっ、あっ、あっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1406,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1406","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「そうしたら、あぁあんっ、紫苑に、怒られちゃう、かもっ？\nふああっ、はぁ、ああ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1411,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1411","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「バレてもいいっ……その時は、その時だよっ！\n今はただっ、水蓮姉とこうして繋がっていたいっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1416,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1416","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「――くはぁぁぁぁああああんんんっっ！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1419,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1419","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"後のことなんて考える余地がなかった。\n今はこの快感を、水蓮姉のとろとろに蕩けた性器を、味わいたい。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1423,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1423","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ベッドが激しく軋む。\n繋がった場所がグッチャグッチャとが卑猥な水音を立てる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1427,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1427","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"肉竿に伝わる媚肉がひくひくと震えるのすら、感じられる。\n襞を解し、擦り上げ、突き込むごとに、腰奥にむずむずと疼きが湧く。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1432,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1432","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んはぁあっ、あぁあああっ！！　あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1436,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1436","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「おちんちん、あぁあああんっ！！ビクンビクンしてきてるっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1440,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1440","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「出そうなのっ？　あっ、はぁっ、んぁああんっ……！！\n精子っ、あっ、あっ、出したいのっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1445,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1445","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁっ……はぁっ……！　出そう、またイきそう……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1449,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1449","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「このまま水蓮姉の膣内にっ、く、うぅ……全部、出したいっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1452,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1452","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"考えるよりも早く、口が動いた。裡から溢れる欲望に突き動かされていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1456,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1456","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「いいよっ……！！もちろんいいよっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1460,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1460","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんの膣内にいっぱい出してっ？\n一滴残らずっ、あっ、あっ、吐き出しちゃってっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1464,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1464","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ギュムッと膣が強く締まる。\nその搾り出すような動きに射精感がさらに高まってくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1474,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1474","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あああっ、きてるっ……！！　のぼってきてるっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1478,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1478","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「精子っ……！！すぐそこまでっ、あっ、あっ、きてるぅっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1482,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1482","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「今度は離さないからっ！　ふぁ、んっ、あぁあんっ！\n絶対にこのおちんちん、離さないからねっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1487,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1487","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「だから安心してっ、はぁあああんっっ！\n安心してっ、思う存分、出してぇっ！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1491,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1491","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"髪を振り乱し、激しく悶える水蓮姉がとにかくエロい。\nぼくの精液に身を汚しながら喘ぐ姿に精子たちが猛る。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1495,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1495","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"このまま膣内で射精したい。ただただそこにあるだろう快楽に、\n溺れるようにすがりたい。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1500,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1500","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！　くるっ！！\nんぁあああっっ！！　くるっ、くるっ、くるぅっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1504,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1504","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の切羽詰ったような嬌声を聞きながら、\n声もなく、呼吸も忘れて必死に腰を振る。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1509,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1509","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「全部っ！　全部出してっ！\nお姉ちゃんの膣内にっ、おまんこにっ、全部出してぇっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1514,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1514","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「えっちな精子でっ、お姉ちゃんをいっぱいにしてぇぇえええっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1530,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1530","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ――あぁぁあああああああっっ！！\nふぁぁああああああああああああっっ～～！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1534,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1534","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"叫ぶような水蓮姉の言葉に合わせるように、子宮に精を注ぎ込む。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1537,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1537","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もっと奥に届けと水蓮姉の子宮にちんこを押しつけて。\n水蓮姉もこれでもかと腰を沈めてきて。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1541,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1541","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"生物としての本能なのか、瞼の裏がチカチカとするほどの快感。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1545,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1545","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁぁぁあああっっ、あっ、あああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1550,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1550","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「す、すごいっ！！　んっ、んはあぁぁ……！！\nたくさんっ、ああああっ、熱いのがっ、お腹にっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1555,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1555","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「精子がっ、あああっ、ふぁあっ、ああっ！！\nいっぱい……いっぱい入ってきてるぅっ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1559,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1559","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"全身をビクつかせながら水蓮姉が恍惚とした笑みを浮かべる。\n幸せそうにぼくの精子を受け止め続けてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1563,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1563","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"それどころか、膣は奥へと誘導するように脈動し、\n精液を搾り取ろうとするかのような動きを見せる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1569,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1569","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んんっ！！　んっ！！　んふぅぅんっっ！！\nあああっ、全部っ、全部ちょうだいっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1574,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1574","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「くはぁぁ……！！　ああっ、あああ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1577,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1577","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"気づけばぼくの方が快感に翻弄されていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1580,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1580","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"膣がまるで吸い上げポンプのようにグっ、グっと動いて、\nその強烈な圧迫感に全ての精が搾取されていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1584,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1584","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"それこそ本当に一滴残らず飲み干されてしまって――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1597,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1597","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んはぁ、はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！\nえへへ……、これでぜーんぶ、みたいだね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1602,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1602","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あぁっ……！　うっ……くあ、あああ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1605,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1605","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"射精を終えた頃には、精も根も尽き果てたような気分だった。\n全身に快感の余韻と心地よい倦怠感が広がって行く。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1611,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1611","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ、とっても気持ちよくなってもらえたみたいで良かった。\nでも、ちょっぴりやりすぎだったかな？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1616,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1616","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「い、いや……本当にすごく、はぁ……はぁ……気持ちよくて……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1620,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1620","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「なら……ふふ。これからも今夜くらいたっぷりと\n気持ちよくしてあげる、ね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1625,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1625","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「……う、うん……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1628,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1628","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"思わず、頷いてしまった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1631,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1631","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"でも、こんな風に水蓮姉に甘えるばかりで、いいんだろうか……。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1635,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1635","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「……もう。また難しいこと考えてる」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1639,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1639","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「そ、そんなことは……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1643,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1643","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私のことで悩まなくたっていいんだよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1646,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1646","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくの内心は見透かされているようだった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1650,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1650","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私はあなたのお世話をしてあげたいだーけ。\nあなたは我慢ばかりしちゃうクセがあるから心配なの」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1656,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1656","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「我慢なんてしなくていいよ？　今夜みたいに、\n身も心も全部曝け出しちゃっていいんだから。ね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1660,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1660","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉が穏やかで優しい笑みを向けてくれる。\n見つめているだけで溺れそうになってしまいそうな微笑みを。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1665,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1665","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「気持ちいいコトが好きなら……ふふ。\nお姉ちゃんはいつでも付き合ってあげるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1670,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1670","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「っ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1673,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1673","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"諭すように話しかけられて、\nぼくは咄嗟に顔を逸らしてしまった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1677,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1677","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"見惚れてしまって、間の抜けた顔になっていそうなぼくの顔を、\n見つめられるのが、恥ずかしくなってしまって。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1682,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1682","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1685,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1685","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんなぼくを見て水蓮姉がおかしそうに笑う。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1689,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1689","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「じゃあスッキリしたところでお風呂入り直そっか？\n汗もいっぱい掻いちゃったしね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1694,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1694","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あー……そうだね。水蓮姉、先に入っていいよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1698,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1698","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ダーメ。一緒に入ろう？\nお姉ちゃんが身体流してあげるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1703,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1703","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「いや、でも……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1707,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1707","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ。して欲しくないの？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1711,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1711","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「うっ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1715,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1715","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「……ふふ。じゃあ今度は私が先にお風呂で待ってるね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1719,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1719","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「来てくれるの、ふふ。ずっと待ってるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1722,"id":"su08_02h.ks#1722","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"本当に、水蓮姉には敵わないなぁ、とぼくは感じたのだった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""}
